window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>New York Times Bestselling author L.P. Dover delivers smoldering passion and gripping suspense in the epic Forever Fae series conclusion. Armed with an ancient scroll, the fae have discovered how to defeat the dark sorcerer and his evil reign. But, unfortunately, one thing stands in the way of them implementing it. All four courts must be bonded for them to become invincible.</p> <p>The bond of Ariella of the Summer Court, and Brayden, of the Winter Court will not come easy. Ariella is known for being headstrong and mischievous, while Brayden is dutiful with a heart of ice. Ariella is well aware that the fate of their land rests on her shoulders. But how can she complete the bond when the man meant to help her fulfill the prophecy doesn’t believe in love?</p> <p>Ariella is ready to make the needed sacrifice of battling the sorcerer alone to save the people she loves. For her own protection, her people insist on a competition to find her Guardian.</p> <p>Brayden knows he blew his chance with her. Ariella avoids him at all costs. But if he can win the competition, he may be able to prove himself yet.</p> <p>Can Brayden make Ariella see him for the man he truly is in time to complete their bond? Or will her final stand against the dark sorcerer end in her ultimate demise?</p> <p>**Steamy New Adult Fantasy Romance**\"</p>"; 
